 "details": {
  "title": "Misty, as Ella sings it",
  "lead": "Ella Fitzgerald’s line in Misty, note for note from her record with piano, set on the record’s own beats, about 63. The first A is in B♭; at its end she slides up a half step, and the rest is in B, as she sings it: her turns on the long notes, the low dips, the runs into the high notes, and her ending. Concert E3 to C♯5. Each note starts where it starts on the record (yt1s.com_-_Ella_Fitzgerald__Misty.mp3), so the part plays with it from her first note.",
